&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dragos is an Equal Opportunity Employer and considers applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, orientation, national origin, age, disability, genetics, or any other basis forbidden under federal, state, or local laws. All new hires must pass a background check as a condition of employment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:3935034.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurial surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reconciles discrepancies in inventory. Performs miscellaneous job-related duties as assigned including but not limited to data entry, consolidation, physical location checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cycle Counts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systemically account for all items that are physically in a single location and fix any quantity discrepancies that exist in the FC using a PDA device.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expiry Pull&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove expired product from inventory using the adjustment function. A list is provided to determine which product will be pulled based on the each item’s shelf life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Audits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check put aways to correct discrepancies and any poor quality put aways found.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adjustments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize the adjustment function to correct discrepancies when needed and fulfill production needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consolidation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move product from one location to another utilizing a PDA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer Literacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Aptitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail Oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work fast paced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast Paced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Noise Levels varies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High and low warehouse seasonal temperatures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimal exposure to dust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical demands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to stand 10+ hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to bend and lift up to 60 lbs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to push/pull up to 50 lbs of exerted force&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred education and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or GED&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Similar FC / Inventory Control experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Disclaimer:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;This is not necessarily an exhaustive list of all responsibilities, duties, skills, efforts, requirements or working conditions associated with the job. While this is intended to be an accurate reflection of the current job, management reserves the right to revise the job or to require that other or different tasks be performed as assigned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation reflects the cost of labor across several US geographic markets.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hourly pay rates range from&amp;nbsp;$18 to $21, plus&amp;nbsp;any overtime. Pay rate depends on position, shift, and experience.&amp;nbsp;Pay is based on several factors including market location and may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Coupang is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to actual or perceived race (including traits historically associated with race, including but not limited to hair texture and protective hair styles), color, religion, religious creed (including religious dress and grooming practices), sex or gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, breastfeeding, and medical conditions related to pregnancy, childbirth or breastfeeding), gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, ancestry, national origin (including language use restrictions), age (40 and over), physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, HIV/AIDS or Hepatitis C status, family status (including but not limited to marital or domestic partnership status), military or veteran status, use of a trained dog guide or service animal, political activities or affiliations, ancestry, citizenship, family and medical leave status, status as a victim of any violent crime, or any other characteristic or class protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we operate. Coupang is also committed to providing a safe work environment for its employees and its consumers. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation in the application of recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:usrecruiting@coupang.com&quot;&gt;usrecruiting@coupang.com&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:6899061.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal, Tech Executive Sourcing (Contractor)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurial surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal, Tech Executive Sourcer at Coupang, you will leverage AI tools to map and source top Tech Executive Talent in the global market. This role involves developing and executing sourcing strategies for senior leadership positions, identifying candidates, and building talent pools with high-potential individuals to support Coupang&#39;s growth in the e-commerce industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with tech executive recruiters and hiring managers to create and implement sourcing strategies for identifying future technology leaders at Coupang.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and approach executive-level candidates independently, converting prospects into candidates for active roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the e-commerce and tech industries, with a focus on the APAC region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with tech executive recruiters and senior business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with tech executive recruiters to provide a consultative approach to sourcing and talent pipeline development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess candidates for qualification matches, cultural fit, and compatibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track project milestones and timelines, adjusting plans as needed to ensure successful project completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 8 years of recruitment or business-related experience, with at least 4 years of executive sourcing experience in a results-oriented environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience sourcing technology leaders within a technology or high-growth company is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-oriented with strong focus on understanding and meeting customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; ability to sell the Coupang proposition to executive-level candidates internationally. Fluency in English is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical with a strong understanding of AI sourcing tools and expertise in building complex Boolean searches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and able to work independently in a dynamic, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7919597.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 6.6041in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-left: 0in; width: 6.6041in;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Coupang&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;reimagining&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;shopping&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;goal&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;wowing&amp;nbsp;each&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;instant&amp;nbsp;they&amp;nbsp;open&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Coupang&amp;nbsp;app&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;moment&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;order&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;delivered&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;door.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Our&amp;nbsp;services&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Taiwan&amp;nbsp;include&amp;nbsp;“Rocket&amp;nbsp;Delivery”&amp;nbsp;which&amp;nbsp;offers&amp;nbsp;next-day&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;wide&amp;nbsp;selection&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;items&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;affordable&amp;nbsp;prices,&amp;nbsp;“Rocket&amp;nbsp;Overseas”&amp;nbsp;which&amp;nbsp;offers&amp;nbsp;free&amp;nbsp;international&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;millions&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;best-selling&amp;nbsp;products&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;Korea,&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;U.S.,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;looking&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;talents&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;help&amp;nbsp;us&amp;nbsp;lead&amp;nbsp;Coupang’s&amp;nbsp;expansion&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Taiwan.&amp;nbsp;This&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;exceptional&amp;nbsp;opportunity&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;become&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;part&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;Coupang’s&amp;nbsp;growth&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Taiwan&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;world&amp;nbsp;where&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;customers&amp;nbsp;wonder,&amp;nbsp;“How&amp;nbsp;did&amp;nbsp;I&amp;nbsp;ever&amp;nbsp;live&amp;nbsp;without&amp;nbsp;Coupang?”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh-TW&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Position&amp;nbsp;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh-TW&quot;&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/span&gt; (Growth)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;do?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;1. Problem Definition &amp;amp; Critical Thinking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Role: Identify and define the most impactful problems to solve within the growth channel. You must distinguish between symptoms and root causes to ensure the engineering and business teams are working on the right priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Expectation: You provide the logic and data-backed reasoning for the product roadmap. You are expected to challenge assumptions and break down complex channel dynamics into clear, actionable strategies that drive incremental growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; margin-left: .375in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;2. Technical Strategy &amp;amp; Integration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Role: Own the technical plan for channel automation, focusing on how product data is structured and how bidding logic is applied at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Expectation: You work directly with engineers to ensure system architecture is robust. You must be able to understand API documentation and technical constraints to prevent performance bottlenecks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;3. Data &amp;amp; Autonomous Analytics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Role: Monitor channel performance and investigate deviations from targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Expectation: While you work with Data Science, you do not rely on them for daily needs. You are expected to write your own SQL, build your own dashboards, and perform independent analysis to find the &quot;why&quot; behind the numbers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;4. Platform Expertise &amp;amp; Operational Insight&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Role: Maintain a deep, hands-on understanding of the channel’s operational workflows to identify product friction and improvement opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Expectation: While you do not manage daily campaigns, you must be a power user of the platform. You are expected to know exactly how to set up and troubleshoot campaigns to identify user pain points, manual bottlenecks, and areas where automation can be improved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;5. User Experience &amp;amp; Design Support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Role: Oversee the customer journey from the initial advertisement to the final purchase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The Expectation: You partner with Designers to improve conversion. If the design team is unavailable or needs direction, you are capable of creating wireframes or initial prototypes to maintain project momentum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Basic&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8–12+ years in Product Management, with significant experience in &lt;strong&gt;high-scale Growth, Ads, eCommerce or Performance Marketing.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Professional English and Chinese speaker.&lt;/strong&gt; You must be able to navigate complex technical discussions in English and local operational requirements in Chinese fluently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level critical thinking skills with a focus on &quot;Root Cause&quot; analysis and problem definition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong technical familiarity with major digital ad platforms and their internal campaign management interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in SQL is required; experience with prototyping tools (e.g., Figma) is preferred. Using AI tools for automation and prototyping is a must.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independence:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of delivering complex products as a senior individual contributor in an ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in using AI tools to create product prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Side hustles on building Applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Recruitment&amp;nbsp;Process&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Recruitment&amp;nbsp;Process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Application&amp;nbsp;Review&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Phone&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Onsite&amp;nbsp;(or&amp;nbsp;Virtual&amp;nbsp;Onsite)&amp;nbsp;Interview&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;Offer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;exact&amp;nbsp;nature&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;recruitment&amp;nbsp;process&amp;nbsp;may&amp;nbsp;vary&amp;nbsp;according&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;specific&amp;nbsp;job&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;may&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;changed&amp;nbsp;due&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;scheduling&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;circumstances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Interview&amp;nbsp;schedules&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;results&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;informed&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;applicant&amp;nbsp;via&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;e-mail&amp;nbsp;address&amp;nbsp;submitted&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;application&amp;nbsp;stage.&lt;/p&gt;
