&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Business System Analyst to join our IT Business Apps team. This is a hybrid role based in Zscaler office location in Bangalore/Mohali reporting to Senior Manager&amp;nbsp; IT Business Systems team. In this role, you will leverage your deep expertise in business processes, technical knowledge, and project management skills to implement scalable and impactful solutions that improve workflows and accelerate decision-making across the organization. While supporting marketing operations, your scope will extend to broader IT systems, establishing a critical link between complex business strategies and reliable technical execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Analysis -Requirements gathering, Discovery meetings, building BRD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Analysis &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User stories, Grooming, QA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. You adapt to what’s needed, navigating seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You seek out challenges because you are energized by finding solutions, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a true growth mindset and never stop developing yourself, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience with an in-depth understanding of marketing technology stacks, Salesforce CRM, data enrichment, integrations, and reporting &amp;amp; insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in implementing and managing enterprise business systems (such as CRM, and data platforms) across diverse departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with a track record of investigating complex technical issues and designing scalable solutions that drive measurable process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced command of SQL for cross-system data analysis. Proven experience using reporting tools like Salesforce to translate complex data sets into actionable business stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with SFDC platforms and lead management process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of global data privacy regulations (e.g., GDPR, CCPA) and integration principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications (What Will Make You Stand Out)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with API integrations, Agile methodologies, and managing full Lead-to-Opportunity lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundational understanding of Digital Marketing principles and enterprise Project Management practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated capability in using generative AI productivity environments (such as GPT, Gemini, and Claude) to enhance operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RG&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
