&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enable Data-Driven Decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain sophisticated reports and dashboards that provide leadership with real-time insights into global workforce trends and absence patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
