&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re in an unbelievably exciting area of tech and are fundamentally reshaping the data storage industry. Here, you lead with innovative thinking, grow along with us, and join the smartest team in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Python Engineer on the Prague-based Autotriage team, you will drive the development of infrastructure and tools that automatically triage failed tests across Everpure’s large-scale automated environments. By building a distributed, modular system that analyzes failed jobs and groups related issues via signature matching, you will empower engineering teams to prioritize effectively and avoid repetitive analysis. You will combine technical expertise with leadership qualities, collaborating with cross-functional teams globally to introduce ongoing enhancements, including new analysis modules and AI-based insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build advanced tools to analyze test failures across a multi-machine hardware and software stack within a continuous integration automation framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate, maintain, and troubleshoot high-quality CI/CD processes to prevent bottlenecks and ensure the infrastructure remains robust and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a data-driven approach to identify and resolve root causes, delivering continuous support that makes code delivery easier and more efficient for internal engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with various engineering teams across time zones to ensure important fixes are delivered in a timely manner and proactively make improvements to integration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Prague office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python combined with strong debugging and problem-solving skills to independently take ownership of deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational databases (such as PostgreSQL or Redis), alongside a solid understanding of containerization and orchestration tools like Docker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines and test infrastructure, combined with basic knowledge of version control systems like Git.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset and strong communication skills to effectively collaborate with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://purebenefits.com&quot;&gt;purebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
