&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px;&quot;&gt;Write clean, efficient, and scalable code in languages such as NodeJS or Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams, including front-end developers, data scientists, and product managers, to deliver high-quality software solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback to ensure code quality and maintainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
