&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Understanding of DevOps practices and tools like Jenkins, Git, and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
