&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Proficient with Microsoft Excel, Word, PowerPoint, and basic ERP systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Excellent attention to detail with the ability to identify subtle defects and maintain high-quality output in a high-volume environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Positive attitude, strong team player, and willingness to provide constructive feedback to improve designs and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Previous aerospace, automotive, or high-reliability electronics manufacturing experience&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay range: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Production Development Technician/Level 1: $23.00 - $29.00/hour &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Production Development Technician/Level 2: $28.00 - $34.50/hour &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Production Development Technician/Level 3: $33.00 - $40.00/hour &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your actual level and base salary will be determined on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on the following considerations: job-related knowledge and skills, education, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is just one part of your total rewards package at SpaceX. You may also be eligible for long-term incentives, in the form of company stock, stock options, or long-term cash awards, as well as potential discretionary bonuses and the ability to purchase additional stock at a discount through an Employee Stock Purchase Plan. You will also receive access to comprehensive medical, vision, and dental coverage, access to a 401(k) retirement plan, short and long-term disability insurance, life insurance, paid parental leave, and various other discounts and perks. You may also accrue 3 weeks of paid vacation and will be eligible for 10 or more paid holidays per year. Employees in Washington State accrue paid sick time in compliance with state and federal law. Company shuttles are offered to employees for roundtrip travel from select Seattle locations to the SpaceX Redmond office Monday to Friday.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. Learn more about the ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pmddtc.state.gov/?id=ddtc_kb_article_page&amp;amp;sys_id=24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is an Equal Opportunity Employer; employment with SpaceX is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants wishing to view a copy of SpaceX’s Affirmative Action Plan for veterans and individuals with disabilities, or applicants requiring reasonable accommodation to the application/interview process should reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:EEOCompliance@spacex.com&quot;&gt;EEOCompliance@spacex.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-spacex:greenhouse:8544512002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMMERCIAL SALES MANAGER (STARLINK MOBILE)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is developing a new satellite-to-mobile network to bring ubiquitous cellular connectivity worldwide via the Starlink constellation. We are partnering with telecommunication companies around the world to bring this service directly from satellites to mobile phones, with the goal of providing coverage anywhere a phone can see the sky.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starlink was designed to connect the disconnected and this new product will greatly expand that mission by extending coverage to billions of existing cellular devices. The applications range from connecting hikers in national parks, emergency responders, rural communities, remote sensors and devices, and people in emergency situations. You can learn more about the next chapter of the Starlink Mobile program &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.spacex.com/updates#dtc-gen2-spectrum&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Combined with new state-of-the-art satellite technologies, exclusive spectrum, and Starship’s unprecedented payload capacity to low-Earth orbit in a single launch, Starlink Mobile’s next generation service will deliver unparalleled performance to cell phones and IoT devices – helping to close coverage gaps and ultimately eliminate mobile dead zones around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will take ownership of assigned client relationships and commercial opportunities to expand Starlink Mobile globally. While you will receive direct mentorship from your leaders, your work will be largely self-directed. SpaceX evolves rapidly, and you will be a critical asset to the sales team as we work to collectively advance our presence in the telecommunications market globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell Starlink Mobile services, manage customer relationships, and develop new sales opportunities in your designated region or markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize professional selling and business development techniques combined with product knowledge to market Starlink Mobile and other services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather customer requirements and work with the product engineering team to iterate on and improve SpaceX product offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet with the executive team to review business development opportunities, strategy, and current market landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SpaceX in various forums, including conferences, SpaceX events, technology panels, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt and work effectively in a dynamic environment with changing needs and requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a STEM or business disciple&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a business development or sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of technical sales experience or experience working in the telecommunications industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of satellites, global telecommunications industry, and/or NTN and satellite-based systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or master&#39;s degree with a business or engineering-focused curriculum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently motivated professional with a demonstrated track record of pursuing and closing complex deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal, presentation, and negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical aptitude for the products you’ve supported&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills in business and technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly detail oriented, diligent, and hard working with excellent customer interface skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completed sales training coursework in Miller Heiman’s Strategic Selling, or a similar program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multilingual&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is based in Washington, DC and requires being onsite – remote work not considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be available to work extended hours and weekends as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel approximately 50% of the time to customer locations, other SpaceX locations, and events as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pay range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;Commercial Sales Manager: $110,000 - $150,000/per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your actual level and base salary will be&amp;nbsp;determined&amp;nbsp;on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on the following considerations: job-related knowledge and skills, education, and experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Base salary is just one part of your total rewards package at SpaceX. You may also be eligible for long-term incentives, in the form of company stock, stock options, or long-term cash awards, as well as potential discretionary bonuses and the ability to&amp;nbsp;purchase&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;stock at a discount through an Employee Stock Purchase Plan. You will also receive access to comprehensive medical, vision, and dental coverage, access to a&amp;nbsp;401(k) retirement&amp;nbsp;plan, short and long-term disability insurance, life insurance, paid parental leave, and various other discounts and&amp;nbsp;perks. You may also&amp;nbsp;accrue&amp;nbsp;3 weeks of paid vacation and will be eligible for 10 or more paid holidays per year. Employees&amp;nbsp;accrue&amp;nbsp;paid sick leave&amp;nbsp;pursuant to&amp;nbsp;Company policy which satisfies or exceeds the accrual, carryover, and use requirements of the law.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;This position is also eligible for a sales bonus plan. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. Learn more about the ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pmddtc.state.gov/?id=ddtc_kb_article_page&amp;amp;sys_id=24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is an Equal Opportunity Employer; employment with SpaceX is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants wishing to view a copy of SpaceX’s Affirmative Action Plan for veterans and individuals with disabilities, or applicants requiring reasonable accommodation to the application/interview process should reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:EEOCompliance@spacex.com&quot;&gt;EEOCompliance@spacex.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-spacex:greenhouse:8570197002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CMF DESIGNER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Color, Material, and Finish Designer on the Starlink team, you’ll play a pivotal role in shaping the look, feel, and quality of next-generation consumer electronics and hardware that connect the world. You’ll contribute to the full development and execution of innovative materials, colors, and finishes, bringing deep expertise to elevate product aesthetics, durability, and user experience while pushing the boundaries of what’s possible in high-volume manufacturing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead CMF innovation, select and implement the highest-quality materials and processes, and collaborate closely with design, engineering, and operations teams as well as external suppliers to deliver production-ready solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze, refine, and approve colors, materials, and finishes across active projects to ensure they meet the highest standards of quality and brand alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curate and maintain a robust internal library of cutting-edge, inspirational materials and finishes, proactively sourcing innovative options to fuel Starlink’s design evolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideate, visualize, and develop compelling CMF design proposals that push creative and technical boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft impactful digital and physical CMF presentations that articulate a bold, forward-looking vision for the Starlink product ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams (design, engineering, and manufacturing) to strategize and successfully implement production-ready CMF solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect and execute design intent through precise color tuning, material mastering, and oversight across all product commodities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide CMF execution from early prototypes through full-scale production, ensuring seamless translation from concept to hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture strong supplier and vendor relationships, continuously identifying new resources to enable groundbreaking material innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a design discipline (i.e. industrial, transportation, product, architecture) and 1+ years professional CMF experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical expertise in mass production, manufacturing processes, and a wide range of materials, with proven ability to deliver high-quality CMF designs under tight deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional color acuity, including the ability to pass the Munsell Hue Color Test with a perfect score&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in 2D and 3D visualization tools such as Photoshop, Illustrator, Blender, KeyShot, and similar software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding visual, verbal, and presentation skills, able to clearly communicate complex CMF concepts and influence stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at building and maintaining effective cross-functional relationships with design, engineering, manufacturing, and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly self-motivated, adaptable, and organized, with the ability to successfully manage multiple parallel projects in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual portfolio is mandatory for consideration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is not a remote or hybrid position and will require relocation if not already local to the Austin, TX area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position occasionally requires the ability to work extended hours, weekends and offsite when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. Learn more about the ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pmddtc.state.gov/?id=ddtc_kb_article_page&amp;amp;sys_id=24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is an Equal Opportunity Employer; employment with SpaceX is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants wishing to view a copy of SpaceX’s Affirmative Action Plan for veterans and individuals with disabilities, or applicants requiring reasonable accommodation to the application/interview process should reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:EEOCompliance@spacex.com&quot;&gt;EEOCompliance@spacex.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-spacex:greenhouse:8570230002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRAPHIC DESIGNER (STARLINK)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Graphic Designer on the Starlink design team, you’ll own the complete customer packaging experience, crafting everything from the box and external-facing visuals to the unboxing journey and clear installation instructions. You’ll play a key role in building on Starlink’s brand story externally, creating compelling visuals that support retail, marketing, and direct customer touchpoints while delivering an on-brand experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role demands a sharp eye for detail, flawless execution, and the creativity to transform complex technology into intuitive, visually engaging communications that resonate with users worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sketch, storyboard, and ideate impactful concepts for physical packaging, print collateral, and user-facing graphics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate cutting-edge technology into simple, intuitive instructions and clear visual communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement regulatory, legal, compliance graphics to meet product requirements with precision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support A/B testing for the unboxing experience and installation guides, rapidly iterating based on feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen and elevate Starlink’s customer-facing brand identity through compelling visuals, storytelling, and cohesive design execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver flawless production-ready assets for high-volume printing, working efficiently with vendors to ensure quality and on-time delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding verbal and visual communication skills, able to clearly articulate and present complex design concepts to engineers, and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to thrive in a fast-paced, highly integrated team environment with daily cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in graphic design, marketing, communications, art, web design, or advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of professional design experience in illustration, graphic design, or print production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional graphic design experience, ideally within a creative agency or consumer tech environment focused on digital products and packaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of industry-standard 2D tools including Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign) and Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with 3D visualization tools such as Blender, KeyShot, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in layout, color theory, typography, and visual systems to art-direct and produce compelling digital and physical assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience preparing production-ready files, understanding printer specifications, and successfully managing external print vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at creating clean 2D assets, iconography, motion graphics, animation, and dynamic interactions that enhance user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced capabilities in image optimization, retouching, manipulation, and precise color correction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of digital production standards to deliver pixel-perfect, on-brand assets for both web/apps and high-volume physical print&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional visual and conceptual skills with the ability to solve complex problems and develop fresh, innovative design solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual portfolio is mandatory for consideration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is not a remote or hybrid position and will require relocation if not already local to the Austin, TX area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position occasionally requires the ability to work extended hours, weekends and offsite when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. Learn more about the ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pmddtc.state.gov/?id=ddtc_kb_article_page&amp;amp;sys_id=24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is an Equal Opportunity Employer; employment with SpaceX is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants wishing to view a copy of SpaceX’s Affirmative Action Plan for veterans and individuals with disabilities, or applicants requiring reasonable accommodation to the application/interview process should reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:EEOCompliance@spacex.com&quot;&gt;EEOCompliance@spacex.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

gaingels-udemy:greenhouse:6017878004.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coursera and Udemy are now one company, creating one of the world’s most comprehensive skills development platforms for the AI era. This strengthens our ability to accelerate AI-powered innovation and shape how the world discovers and builds skills at a pivotal moment of change. Read more about the combined company by visiting our &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.coursera.org/coursera-and-udemy-are-now-one-company-creating-the-worlds-most-comprehensive-skills-platform/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Udemy&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.udemy.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54530891&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260507908926&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Udemy&amp;amp;index=2&amp;amp;md5=365f043bb16374e743ea6b92d0aa4d5f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Udemy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is an AI-powered skills acceleration platform transforming how companies and individuals across the world build the capabilities needed to thrive in a rapidly evolving workplace. By combining on-demand, multi-language content with real-time innovation, Udemy delivers personalized experiences that empower organizations to scale workforce development and help individuals build the technical, business, and soft skills most relevant to their careers. Today, thousands of companies, including Samsung SDS America, On24, Tata Consultancy Services, The World Bank, and Volkswagen, rely on Udemy Business for its enterprise solutions to build agile, future-ready teams. Udemy is headquartered in San Francisco, with hubs across the United States, Australia, India, Ireland, Mexico, and Türkiye. Udemy recently combined with Coursera to create one of the world’s most comprehensive skills development platforms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Udemy is a global company headquartered in San Francisco, with additional U.S. offices in Denver and Austin, and international hubs in Australia, India, Ireland, Mexico, and Türkiye. &lt;em&gt;This is a hybrid position, requiring three days a week in the office (Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday) and flexibility on Mondays and Fridays.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About your skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a business analyst who’s passionate about turning raw data into meaningful insight and action. You know that great analysis doesn’t just explain what happened; it helps people understand &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; it matters and &lt;em&gt;what to do next&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re fluent in SQL, Python and Tableau, and comfortable navigating ambiguous business problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You thrive in cross-functional environments and when working closely with Sales, Customer Success, Partnerships, Marketing, Product, and Finance teams. You’re equal parts technical and communicative, and the intersection of analytics and storytelling excites you.&amp;nbsp; You enjoy mining data for actionable insights, uncovering patterns in behavior that drive business outcomes, and presenting trends/ad hoc findings to business partners and senior leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re curious, a fast learner, and constantly thinking about how to scale your impact through automation and proactive insight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Analytics Lead for Japan Partnerships is a highly visible and impactful role, focused on supporting Udemy&#39;s largest partnerships. You will provide deep, actionable analytics and insights for Japan and indirect partner channels, enabling the channel sales team to optimize partner performance, make data-driven decisions, and accelerate regional revenue growth&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;As this role will require regular interaction with our Japan-based partner teams, fluency in both Japanese and English is a requirement for this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop, manage, and evolve the key performance indicators (KPIs) and reporting framework for the Udemy Japan Team and partner ecosystem and other indirect/reseller channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain dashboards (in Tableau and Databricks) that track Udemy Japan efforts including partner-sourced pipeline, revenue, deal registrations, and partner performance against targets in both Udemy Business and Udemy Consumer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct in-depth analysis of the Udemy Japan business, identifying trends, key user behaviors, and opportunities for growth or optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support the Japan Partner Account Managers with data and insights for partner-facing events such as Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs) and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the primary data and analytics point of contact for the Udemy Japan leadership and the global partner operations team.&amp;nbsp; Partner with the Director of Japan Business Operations to review and understand use of shared data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyze the effectiveness of partner initiatives and promotions in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist in forecasting for both Corporate and Consumer business, collaborating with sales, marketing and finance teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll have&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency in both Japanese and English is required to enable communication with our partner in Japan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5-7 years of work experience in analytics or data science roles, ideally with at least 1-2 years of direct experience supporting B2B SaaS, Partnership, or GTM analytics (Customer Success, Sales, RevOps).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expert-level SQL skills; experience with Databricks or similar cloud data warehouses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in data visualization tools, particularly Tableau, with a strong eye for visual storytelling and usability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication and storytelling skills; ability to meet with customers and internal stakeholders to present insights with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with segmentation and statistical analysis to support business decision-making is a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with Python or other scripting languages is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proactive mindset, strong ownership, and a collaborative approach to working across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posting Date:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; June 11th, 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Window:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We anticipate the application window will be open until June 24th, 2026. Based on business needs, this opportunity may remain posted beyond or closed before the anticipated application window.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1778108758.062389&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Udemy, we strive to be transparent around compensation. Actual compensation for this role is based on several factors, including but not limited to job-related skills, qualifications, and experience. In addition to a base salary, this role is also eligible for equity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Hiring Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll grow here.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Learning is part of the job. You’ll get full access to Udemy courses, a monthly UDay to invest in yourself, and a budget to spend on whatever helps you improve. Many people are diving into AI lately, but what you focus on is up to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI is real here.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We use it in the way we learn and the way we work. You’ll have the space and tools to experiment, apply, and get better at using AI in practical ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll own your work.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We trust people to lead, make decisions, and follow through. You don’t need to wait for permission or layers of approval to have an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll build with others.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We collaborate openly and shape ideas together. Everyone has a voice, and good thinking is welcomed from any direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll see your impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;What you build helps people grow their skills, change their careers, or find a path forward. You’ve got the experience, why not use it to help others gain theirs?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bring your curiosity. We’ll bring the platform and the support. Let’s &lt;strong&gt;LEARN&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits Start with U&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits start with you and were built to provide you and your family with the protection and care you need, making it easy to access the right coverage when you need it most. Benefits vary by region, and we encourage applicants to review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/au/au-home&quot;&gt;Australia Benefits, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/in/in-home&quot;&gt;India Benefits,&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/ie/ie-home&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Ireland Benefits,&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/mx/home&quot;&gt;Mexico Benefits&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/tr/home&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Turkiye Benefits&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.udemybenefits.com/us/home&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;US Benefits,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;pages to get an understanding of some of the benefits we offer. For details on region-specific benefits, please refer to the information provided during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter__right&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits outlined are provided as a general overview and may vary depending on the location, role, and employment classification. All benefits are subject to change at the discretion of the organization and in accordance with applicable laws and policies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Udemy, we value diversity and inclusion and consider qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, ancestry, age, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital or family status, veteran status, medical condition, or disability. We understand that not everyone will match each of the qualifications. However, we also realize that everyone has unique experiences that can add value to our company. Even if you think your background might not perfectly align, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To protect against recruitment fraud, Coursera + Udemy recruiters only communicate via official coursera.org/udemy.com email addresses and never through personal accounts. We do not accept resumes via email or social media; please submit all applications directly through our careers page. If you encounter suspicious recruitment activity, please report it via our&lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/Mb8UktwuaJAukb3H7&quot;&gt; Fraudulent Activity Submission Form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information regarding data privacy is available within the&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.udemy.com/careers-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt; Udemy Careers Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

goodwatercap-fever:greenhouse:4789276101.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growth is the team responsible for promoting the Fever business plan across all Markets and ensuring that our Partners and experiences perform as expected, helping them grow within Fever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our decisions are data-driven from the highest to the lowest strategy level, allowing us to fully understand the Fever business model and how we can leverage this to interact with every single team within the company to grow the business in the expected direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Growth Manager&amp;nbsp;with a structured mindset, who loves to improve efficiency in everything and always finds a way to get things done! The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;W&amp;amp;A team&lt;/strong&gt; is central in enabling Fever to scale rapidly and capture new markets. As a Growth Manager within the W&amp;amp;A team, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic initiatives impacting the way teams operate to ensure peak performance across departments, guiding projects from inception to implementation and change management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an integral part of the AI strategy definition, implementation, and success tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the complete development lifecycle of in-house tools, systems and processes, ensuring they meet strategic objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct comprehensive audits to streamline team’s requirements, significantly enhancing overall efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align the organization&#39;s business needs with technological and operational solutions by managing critical tools and procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of key processes and engage with department managers worldwide, spanning 50+ countries and diverse nationalities from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a Master’s degree in Engineering, Mathematics, Statistics, or Data Analytics (STEM degree)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring to the table +5 years of experience in Strategy/Operations Consulting, Start-up/Scale-up Strategy, or Transformation in Corporate, demonstrating ownership, high levels of accountability, attention to detail, and a proactive, self-motivated approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a natural self-learner, and can push yourself to explore relevant new technologies, understand them and find optimal implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess strong analytical and quantitative skills as well as a strong bias towards data-based decision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to overview processes, identify errors, propose, and implement improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your exceptional written and verbal communication skills enable you to excel in cross-functional collaboration and effectively convey complex concepts to diverse audiences with varying backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in both written and spoken English is a must, while knowledge of additional languages is a valuable asset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Higher degree (MBA, PhD in a relevant field such as Strategy or Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python, JavaScript, SQL and other programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge about the state of the art in AI and Automation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS &amp;amp; PERKS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attractive compensation package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to have a real impact in a high-growth global category leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40% discount on all Fever events and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a location in the heart of Madrid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office friendly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsibility from day one and professional and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great work environment with a young, international team of talented people to work with!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible remuneration with a 100% tax exemption through Cobee&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English &amp;amp; Spanish Lessons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WellHub membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have free snacks, drinks, and fruit at the office!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibility to receive in advance part of your salary by Payflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun  BCX0 SCXO243620961&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX0 SCXO243620961&quot;&gt;#LI-hybrid #LI-fulltime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

goodwatercap-fever:greenhouse:4858213101.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Fever Originals team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will leverage data, market insights, and strong commercial instincts to create one-of-a-kind events and experiences that enable people to enjoy unforgettable moments. Our goal is to develop and scale innovative experiences while building strong relationships with venues, partners, and industry stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you&#39;ll work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You will join our office in Buenos Aires, working closely with internal teams while directly engaging with partners, providers, and venues across the market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will play a key part in growing Fever’s pipeline of &lt;strong&gt;original events&lt;/strong&gt;. A significant part of your work will involve identifying, developing, and negotiating partnerships with venues and external stakeholders, while collaborating cross-functionally with Project Managers and Producers to bring experiences to life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The team you will join is young, ambitious, and highly collaborative, composed of top profiles from companies such as McKinsey, Amazon, Google, KKR, Cirque du Soleil, PSG, and Roland Garros. Team members bring diverse cultural backgrounds and share a strong entrepreneurial mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Employees are expected to work from the office 2x per week, according to local office policy.&amp;nbsp; This is typically Tuesday and Thursday, but subject to change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As an Account Executive, you will work closely with your regional Team Lead to identify, establish, and maintain relationships with venue operators and negotiate favorable venue rental deals for Fever Original events.&amp;nbsp; The role combines business development with a strong emphasis on strategic venue sourcing, including venue negotiations, persuasive selling, contracting, and networking within the entertainment and events ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;When you join Fever, you will receive training and coaching to help you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and develop new business opportunities, including sourcing venues, partners, and collaborators for new event concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead venue sourcing and contract negotiations, securing optimal terms and building long-term partnerships with strategic venues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Project Managers and Producers to ensure potential venues meet financial and creative requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure the financial and operational feasibility of our events by analyzing and reporting on key metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Scale successful experiences across additional cities and markets by building replicable operational models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone with a strong background in sales, strategic venue sourcing, and/or partnership negotiations and management.&amp;nbsp; You love to prospect relationships and roll up your sleeves to get the deal done.&amp;nbsp; You combine a&lt;strong&gt; strong commercial mindset, relationship-building abilities, and analytical thinking, with a proactive approach to developing partnerships and growing the business.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience in B2B relational sales, venue sourcing / negotiations, and/or partnership development and management (experience in the events industry not required but appreciated)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fluency in English with excellent communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong negotiation and networking skills, with the ability to build meaningful partnerships: you’re not afraid of picking up the phone and pitching to potential new partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional organizational skills, with the ability to plan, prioritize, and drive multiple workstreams to successful completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Resilient and results-driven, able to perform under pressure, take ownership, and manage several high-impact negotiations in parallel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to build and maintain strong relationships with venues, partners, brands, and stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical skills, with the ability to use data to guide decision-making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Highly solution-oriented, able to identify challenges and develop practical strategies to resolve them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work and thrive in fast-paced environments and willingness to grow within the organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will join a team of highly effective, motivated, and entrepreneurial professionals who move fast, take ownership, and get things done. Cultural fit means being humble, open to feedback, and willing to learn, while approaching challenges as opportunities and making decisions based on data and insight. We value individuals who are hands-on, collaborative, and able to prioritize what truly drives results. We encourage applicants from diverse and unconventional backgrounds, especially those who bring curiosity, a willingness to learn, and the drive to make a meaningful impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our Hiring Process:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A 30 min video call with one of our Talent Acquisition Managers, to better understand your career plan, assess cultural fit, and answer any questions you may have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A 60 min online test with three topics: logic, analytics, and written understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A 30 min interview with the hiring manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A 45 min video call with your future manager, including questions about your profile and a business case presentation (to be prepared in advance)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;On average our process lasts 20 working days and offers usually follow within a week.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

goodwatercap-fever:greenhouse:4879300101.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Fever, the&amp;nbsp;Revenue Management team drives marketplace growth by shaping sales strategy, optimizing content and categories, and ensuring top-quality standards across every listing. We analyze performance, refine processes, and empower sales teams to reach their goals. By curating marketplace content and enhancing setup and copy, we maximize visibility and conversion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working closely with QA and Sales, we identify issues early, streamline workflows, and create solutions that keep our marketplace running smoothly and efficiently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Join us if you have a sharp eye for detail, a strategic mindset, and a passion for curating the high-quality content that makes our marketplace a global leader.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;The Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fever for Business is building the future of Live Experiences–as–a–Service for companies worldwide. As Revenue Operations Manager, you will design, build, and scale the commercial engine that powers our global growth. This role owns the pillars of sales strategy, sales operations, revenue operations, and sales productivity, ensuring that our global sales organisation is set up to perform at the highest level. Acting as the Business Partner to the VP of Fever for Business, you will drive long-term planning, forecasting, segmentation, process excellence, rep effectiveness, and cross-functional alignment across the entire GTM. You will partner closely with Sales Leadership, Channels &amp;amp; Alliances, Finance, Strategy, Fever Originals, and Marketing to create a unified, data-driven, high-performance GTM model. This is a foundational global role with the mandate to build a world-class function in an early but rapidly scaling environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;What You´ll Do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Define, build and implement sales operations and revenue operations end-to-end: funnel processes, systems adoption, forecasting discipline, data accuracy, and KPI tracking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Drive sales productivity, including onboarding, enablement, process optimization, rep development, and new-hire ramp acceleration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Sales, Channels &amp;amp; Alliances, Marketing, Finance, Strategy, and Fever Originals to ensure alignment across pipeline, partnerships, GTM campaigns, and revenue initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Oversee pipeline quality &amp;amp; coverage, ensuring predictable, high-conversion funnel performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Optimize our GTM systems (Salesforce, routing/scoring, dashboards, automations, sales engagement workflows) by defining how tools are used and ensuring adoption and efficiency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build and scale the Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations function, developing long-term capabilities, frameworks, and global best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Science, Technology, Engineering or Mathematics (STEM) Degree required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;6+ years experience in Sales Strategy, Sales Operations, or Revenue Operations in SaaS / B2B tech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong strategic and analytical background; MBB consulting experience strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven experience scaling sales or revenue operations in early-stage or growth-stage environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Expertise in forecasting, territory design, quota-setting, sales processes, and funnel analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of CRM and GTM systems (especially Salesforce), including routing, scoring, dashboards, and workflow automation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Exceptional cross-functional collaborator with the ability to influence at all levels across Sales, Finance, Marketing, Strategy, Partnerships, and Product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;High-ownership, high-curiosity builder who can operate at both strategic and operational levels. The ability to make things happen is a must.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Passion for designing the future GTM engine of Fever for Business and enabling us to become the #1 Live Experiences–as–a–Service provider for businesses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
