&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kaseya&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;226&quot; data-end=&quot;568&quot;&gt;Kaseya is the leading provider of AI-powered IT management and cybersecurity software, serving Managed Service Providers (MSPs) and internal IT organizations worldwide. Our comprehensive platform helps organizations efficiently manage, secure, and automate their IT environments, driving operational efficiency and long-term business success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;Backed by &lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.insightpartners.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot; data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;654&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/a&gt;, a leading global software investor, Kaseya has experienced sustained double-digit growth and continues to expand its global footprint. Today, Kaseya supports customers in more than 20 countries and manages over 15 million endpoints worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Founded in 2000, Kaseya has built a culture centered around innovation, accountability, and results. We are a high-growth, high-performance organization that values individuals who are driven, adaptable, and committed to delivering exceptional outcomes for our customers and teammates alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1468&quot;&gt;At Kaseya, success comes from embracing challenges, moving with urgency, and continuously raising the bar.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaseya is looking for a Sr. Manager of Strategy, Planning, &amp;amp; Analytics to focus on strategic and operational initiatives impacting our customer base and customer-facing teams. The ideal candidate for this role is a strategic thinker with an operational bend; they love B2B tech and want to take a role in optimizing our growing business lines. They know how to utilize data-driven insights to shape company priorities and guide the work of multiple departments, not to mention hundreds of co-workers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will support strategy for customer-facing functions, including New Customer Acquisition, Account Management, Marketing, and Product. The role reports directly to the Director of Strategy, Planning, &amp;amp; Analytics. This individual will help influence and drive the strategic direction of the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic and operational initiatives impacting our customer base and customer-facing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and lead impactful, measurable strategies that drive revenue growth and meaningful interactions with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead workstreams with cross-functional teams as necessary to ensure we are bringing the best thinking to key initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage special projects across functions and departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 + years’ experience in strategy, finance, investment banking / PE, or consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in recurring revenue business models is a must have; familiarity with B2B software is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and modeling skills with ability to work across multiple sources of data; Excel ninja&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with finance or financial analytics; able to apply a financial lens to all strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills with a proven ability to work collaboratively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or graduate degree in a quantitative field a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kaseya provides equal employment opportunity to all employees and applicants without regard to race, religion, age, ancestry, gender, sex, sexual orientation, national origin, citizenship status, physical or mental disability, veteran status, marital status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

mbaexchange-kaseya:greenhouse:5977497004.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kaseya&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;226&quot; data-end=&quot;568&quot;&gt;Kaseya is the leading provider of AI-powered IT management and cybersecurity software, serving Managed Service Providers (MSPs) and internal IT organizations worldwide. Our comprehensive platform helps organizations efficiently manage, secure, and automate their IT environments, driving operational efficiency and long-term business success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;Backed by &lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.insightpartners.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot; data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;654&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/a&gt;, a leading global software investor, Kaseya has experienced sustained double-digit growth and continues to expand its global footprint. Today, Kaseya supports customers in more than 20 countries and manages over 15 million endpoints worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Founded in 2000, Kaseya has built a culture centered around innovation, accountability, and results. We are a high-growth, high-performance organization that values individuals who are driven, adaptable, and committed to delivering exceptional outcomes for our customers and teammates alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1468&quot;&gt;At Kaseya, success comes from embracing challenges, moving with urgency, and continuously raising the bar.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaseya&#39;s SaaS Backup products protect M365, Google Workspace, and Salesforce data for hundreds of thousands of businesses globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are building the next generation of our backup storage platform — a unified, cloud agnostic system built to operate at massive scale across trillions of objects and petabytes of data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Staff Engineer, you will own one or more platform services end to end: design, implementation, testing, and production readiness. You work with high autonomy on well-scoped problems and are the go-to technical owner for your domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full lifecycle of a platform service — from design through production deployment and on call support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reliable, well tested backend services in Go with a strong focus on correctness and operational simplicity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement integrations with SaaS APIs (M365, Google Workspace, Salesforce) handling rate limits, delta sync checkpointing, and failure recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate closely with principal and senior engineers on cross service interfaces and data models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Write high quality code that sets the standard for the engineers around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Participate in design reviews and contribute to architectural decisions within your domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–10 years of software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Go/ C++ or equivalent systems language; willing to work in Go day-to-day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid distributed systems fundamentals: consistency, failure handling, idempotency, and retry design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with SQL and at least one database at production scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or consuming REST or gRPC APIs in production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong testing discipline — unit, integration, and fault-condition coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud object storage (S3, GCS, or Azure Blob)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SaaS API integrations (Microsoft Graph, Google Workspace, Salesforce)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka or similar message queue experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work in backup, storage, or data infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Kaseya:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;High ownership over a real production service from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Greenfield platform with strong technical leadership and a clear roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Small team where your contributions are visible and impactful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Competitive salary and benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kaseya provides equal employment opportunity to all employees and applicants without regard to race, religion, age, ancestry, gender, sex, sexual orientation, national origin, citizenship status, physical or mental disability, veteran status, marital status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

