&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proven ability to connect brands to culture in an elevated, brand-right way through a strong network across the&amp;nbsp;beauty and&amp;nbsp;entertainment industry, including film/TV and/or music production companies, creators,&amp;nbsp;reps&amp;nbsp;and brand partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
